      "x": 80,
      "y": 595,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "④ Selection Assistant 卡片 — 6 组选区动作 (仅当编辑器选中文本时激活)：\n  · Expression Revision: Rewrite / Rephrase / Synonyms / More scientific / More precise / Concise / Abbreviate\n  · Structure & Development: Expand / Split sentences / Merge sentences\n  · Metadata Generation: Generate Title / Abstract / Keywords from selection\n  · Comprehension: Summarize / Explain\n  · Citation Support: Add cite placeholder → 插入 [CITATION NEEDED]\n  · Translation: To Chinese / To English",
      "fontSize": 13,
