    {
      "id": "l2-right-tab1-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 980,
      "y": 390,
      "width": 740,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "📚 References Tab — 引用管理面板 (ReferencePanel.tsx)\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\n  动作：Scan citations (扫描 \\cite{}) · Generate .bib · Scan PDFs · Import BibTeX\n  风险分类：\n    ⚠ Citation Placeholders — 尚未决定引用哪篇文献 ([CITATION NEEDED])\n    ⚠ Missing Cite Keys — 已写入 \\cite{key} 但 .bib 中无对应条目\n    ⚠ Uncatalogued PDFs — PDF 文件尚未导入引用库",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
