      "roundness": { "type": 3 }
    },
    {
      "id": "l2-right-tab2-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 980,
      "y": 590,
      "width": 740,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "📑 Outline Tab — 手稿大纲导航 + 快捷文件\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\n  Manuscript Outline：\n    解析 main.tex 中的 \\section / \\subsection / \\subsubsection 标题\n    点击跳转到编辑器中对应行号 · 高亮当前光标所在标题\n  Quick Files：\n    Open paper plan (task/paper-plan.md) · Open research questions (problem/research-questions.md)\n    Create/Open revision log (review/revision-log.md)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
