      "width": 740,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "⚠️ Checks Tab — 写作风险与资产检查\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\n  Blocking Issues (warning)：\n    主动削弱当前写作轮次的阻塞项（如引用缺失、缺少 planning 文件）\n  Needs Review (info)：\n    非硬阻塞但值得关注的跟进事项\n  Assets Status：\n    Paper plan 就绪? · Research questions 就绪? · Revision log 就绪?\n    每项显示 ✓ Ready / ⚠ Empty / Missing 状态",
